                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/1958: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Geneva</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gilbert</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-07T18:00:00-05:00">October 7, 1931—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>67. Department’s 64, October 5, 2 p.m. If you have not already done so, you
                    should read to Drummond the whole text.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
